{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天做一件事",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 88.56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "项目方和交易所，列出每个签名人的设备和云账户，看有没有两个人共用。",
   "spoken": "项目方和交易所，列出每个签名人的设备和云账户，看有没有两个人共用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.532,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 4.63,
   "speechEnd": 9.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "钱包开发者，确认日志和崩溃上报屏蔽密钥材料，发布凭证开启多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "钱包开发者，确认日志和崩溃上报屏蔽密钥材料，发布凭证开启多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.752,
   "dur": 7.368,
   "speechStart": 10.85,
   "speechEnd": 17.29
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "运维负责人，人员离职或漏洞披露后，轮换密钥，并撤销链上权限。",
   "spoken": "运维负责人，人员离职或漏洞批路后，轮换密钥，并撤销链上权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.34,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 18.438,
   "speechEnd": 24.057
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "备份要和主密钥分开放，每年至少演练一次恢复，恢复要多人参与。",
   "spoken": "备份要和主密钥分开放，每年至少演练一次恢复，恢复要多人参与。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.088,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 25.186,
   "speechEnd": 30.828
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，大额放硬件钱包，小额放另一个钱包，两个钱包用不同的助记词。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，大额放硬件钱包，小额放另一个钱包，两个钱包用不同的助记词。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 31.884,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 31.982,
   "speechEnd": 37.732
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "助记词只写在纸或金属板上，不拍照，不存云笔记。",
   "spoken": "助记词只写在纸或金属板上，不拍照，不存云笔记。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.776,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 38.874,
   "speechEnd": 43.433
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "任何客服、网站、表单让你输入助记词，都是诈骗。",
   "spoken": "任何客服、网站、表单让你输入助记词，都是诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 44.492,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 44.59,
   "speechEnd": 49.459
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "硬件钱包屏幕只显示哈希，或者无法解析，就不签。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包屏幕只显示哈希，或者无法解析，就不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 50.52,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 50.618,
   "speechEnd": 55.01
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 56.044,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 56.142,
   "speechEnd": 57.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "六把私钥都没泄露，攻击者也能转走资金。",
   "spoken": "六把私钥都没泄漏，攻击者也能转走资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.424,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 58.522,
   "speechEnd": 61.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "只要签名人看到的和实际签下的不一样，每把钥匙都会照常签名。",
   "spoken": "只要签名人看到的和实际签下的不一样，每把钥匙都会照常签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.652,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 62.75,
   "speechEnd": 68.107
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "能挡住它的，是每个签名人在自己的设备上独立解码，核对屏幕上的字段。",
   "spoken": "能挡住它的，是每个签名人在自己的设备上独立解码，核对屏幕上的字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 69.16,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 69.258,
   "speechEnd": 75.15
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "这只在签名人真正独立时成立。",
   "spoken": "这只在签名人真正独立时成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-13.mp3",
   "start": 76.22,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 76.318,
   "speechEnd": 78.663
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "钥匙放在哪里很重要，签下的是什么，同样重要。",
   "spoken": "钥匙放在哪里很重要，签下的是什么，同样重要。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg6-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.728,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 79.826,
   "speechEnd": 83.564
  },
  {
